06	Display.Conversation	Orrin_Ghost	Someone's climbed my tower. Living, too! How long since anyone living...\Rook sent you? Rook! Still afloat, the old barnacle. Then he wants my chart.\It's yours, if you can take it. I came up here to read the sky with Shards in my eyes, and the Shards read me back. What they read stood up and walked off with my face and my chart. It's down among the stones below the tower.	I'll break it.	07	Not yet.	22
